# agents/

Role profiles and optional **neo-harness** packs for this monorepo.

| Layout | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| Free-form `*/AGENT.md` | Chat-oriented role cards |
| Pack with `manifest.yml` + `prompts/` | neo-harness PLAN/ACT/REFLECT |

If neo-harness embedded a pack (e.g. `workspace/`), use:

```bash
./scripts/neo start --task-file jobs/<slug>.md --agent workspace -p mock
```
